---
kind: scene
id: hearth.welcomeBack
title: The Hearth, any other morning
components: [../../components/hearth-fire.component.lute]
on: hubVisit
priority: 10
when: 'has(prev.run.outcome)'
---

## Back again

::bg{location="hearth" time="night"}
::use{component="hearthFire" flare=@fireFlare}
<match on="prev.run.outcome">
  <when is="fell">
    @maud{code="0010"}: Floor {{prev.run.floor}} this time. Sit. Drink. Complain if you like.
    @maud{code="0040" when="has(prev.run.fellTo)"}: Was it {{prev.run.fellTo}} again? Don't answer. I can smell it on you.
  </when>
  <when is="escaped">
    @maud{code="0020" emotion="fond"}: Out and back again. You smell of rain. I'd forgotten rain.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @maud{code="0030"}: Back before you left? That's new.
  </otherwise>
</match>
